      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marcellus%2C_Michigan"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Historic Sanborn Fire Insurance Maps from 1893 to 1908 capture Marcellus’s downtown layout, showing hotels, schools, and factories.",
